# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The app uses BrowserRouter, so /app/overview is a client-side path with no file
# behind it. Without this rule Pages answers a hard reload or a shared link on any
# route other than / with its own 404 page — the app only appeared to work as long
# as you never refreshed.
#
# Status 200, not 301: the URL must stay as the user typed it so the router can
# read it. Ignored by hosts that do not use this format, and redundant under the
# wrangler.jsonc Workers-assets flow, which handles it via not_found_handling.
/*  /index.html  200
